 to monitor the vital systems of the Saturn V rocket right up until the second of liftoff. Id X", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:13:15Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "3M?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:13:16Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "3m", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:13:23Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "GE?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:13:26Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Pidilite?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:13:27Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "dupont", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:13:34Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Nice crack", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:13:57Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Let me ask my GE friends if they know this", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:13:58Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "General electric is correct. Formed on this day in 1892", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T16:14:20Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Fact check bhi ho jaega 🙈\nAlthough kia tha ek baar", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]